Package: cmip6r
Title: Download and Visualize CMIP6 Climate Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Nicola", "Held", , "nicola.held@magenta.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to download CMIP6 climate model data from the 
    Copernicus Climate Data Store (CDS) via API and visualize scenarios 
    including temperature, precipitation, and other climate variables.
